  "details": "In order to deal with vandalism, and accidents caused by inexperienced creators/users, it would be useful to be able to disable other players' collider from the safety.\n\nWell, first of all, I wonder why the avatar needs a physical collider...\n\nThose are destroy phyisical-based object. EX: airplane, car, ship, train\n\nTupper also likes the airplane world, and it would be a nightmare for Newbee's flying avatar to crash into the plane I'm on.\n\nFurthermore, by placing collider well, you can lay waste the game world or get in the way of other players.\n\nHonestly, it would be best if there was a setting to disable it on the world side.",
